#: includes/class-casapay-wc-gateway.php:165
msgid "We could not get the CasaPay guarantee price right now. Please try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "CasaPay garantii hinda ei õnnestunud praegu saada. Proovi mõne minuti pärast uuesti."

