#: includes/class-casapay-wc-privacy.php:30
msgid "CasaPay for WooCommerce sends customer data to CasaPay when a customer pays with CasaPay. Review the text below and add it to your privacy policy."
msgstr "CasaPay for WooCommerce saadab kliendi andmed CasaPayle, kui klient maksab CasaPayga. Vaata allolev tekst üle ja lisa see oma privaatsuspoliitikasse."

#: includes/class-casapay-wc-privacy.php:31
msgid "Suggested text:"
msgstr "Soovitatav tekst:"

#: includes/class-casapay-wc-privacy.php:32
msgid "When you pay with CasaPay, we send your name, e-mail address, phone number, personal identification code (if you enter it), order number, ordered items and amounts to CasaPay. CasaPay uses this data to verify your identity, take the payment and, if you choose it, provide a deposit guarantee. On CasaPay's payment page you give your identity and payment details directly to CasaPay. CasaPay's privacy policy explains how they process this data."
msgstr "Kui maksad CasaPayga, saadame CasaPayle sinu nime, e-posti aadressi, telefoninumbri, isikukoodi (kui selle sisestad), tellimuse numbri, tellitud tooted ja summad. CasaPay kasutab neid andmeid sinu isiku tuvastamiseks, makse vastuvõtmiseks ja, kui selle valid, tagatisraha garantii pakkumiseks. CasaPay makselehel annad isiku- ja makseandmed otse CasaPayle. Kuidas CasaPay neid andmeid töötleb, on kirjas CasaPay privaatsuspoliitikas."

#: includes/class-casapay-wc-product.php:28
msgid "CasaPay agreement"
msgstr "CasaPay leping"

#: includes/class-casapay-wc-product.php:30
msgid "The rental becomes a CasaPay agreement. A cart can hold one rental at a time."
msgstr "Üüritoode luuakse CasaPay lepinguna. Ostukorvis saab olla üks üüritoode korraga."

#: includes/class-casapay-wc-product.php:32
msgid "— Not a rental —"
msgstr "— Pole üüritoode —"

#: includes/class-casapay-wc-product.php:33
