msgstr "Ainult OnTime ja Cover. Kuni 15 000. Tühi tähendab, et tagatisraha pole."

#: includes/class-casapay-wc-product.php:54
msgid "Deposit options"
msgstr "Tagatisraha viis"

#: includes/class-casapay-wc-product.php:56
